Package: zapret2
Submenu: Zapret
Version: 1.0.5.2-r3
Depends: +libc +libnetfilter-queue +kmod-nfnetlink-queue +kmod-nft-queue +libmnl +libcap +zlib +luajit
Conflicts: 
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: @zapret2-any
Section: net
Category: Network
Repository: base
Title: zapret2 - anti-DPI engine (nfqws2) with full runtime
Maintainer: 
Source: zapret2-v1.0.5.2.tar.gz
URL: https://github.com/bol-van/zapret2
Type: ipkg
Description: 	zapret2 (nfqws2) is the second-generation anti-DPI engine: a
	programmable packet manipulation tool with Lua-based DPI-bypass
	strategies. This package builds the engine from the upstream
	release tarball and installs the complete stock runtime (Lua
	strategy library, init scripts, default config, ipset lists and
	fake blobs) to /opt/zapret2.
@@


